{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo features <strong>20 levels</strong> from the full version of <i>Hue Hooligans</i>. Across these levels, you'll meet <strong>5 of the 6 playable characters</strong> and experience nearly all the core mechanics that will be available in the full release\u00a0\u2014 giving you a strong sense of how puzzles unfold.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few <strong>special puzzles</strong> are also included for players looking for an <strong>extra challenge</strong> and a glimpse at the game\u2019s later difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime: 1\u20132 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller support:</strong> Only <strong>Xbox controllers</strong> are officially supported in this demo. Other controllers may work, but inputs could be unresponsive or incorrectly mapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>*Progress does not carry over to the full version.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full version content</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Spray_Em_All_12.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The goal of this game is to get all Hooligans to reach their spray indicator and tag it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/I---Spray-_Em-All_3.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Six_Hooligans_5.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/All_Idle_1.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each Hooligan has their own color and ability.</strong> They need to work together in order for all of them to reach their targets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All colors are adjustable in settings. If you have trouble differentiating them, you can change them to your liking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Call_yo_homies_5.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You take control of other Hooligans by calling them on the phone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may hang up whenever you want, and call them as many times as you need. Phone booths are carefully positioned on each level to make complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/II---Call-yo_-homies10.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Clear_da_way_3.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The main obstacles are doors</strong>, which are controlled by either buttons, levers, or pressure plates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/III---Clear-da-way_2.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Come_back_later.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you\u2019re stuck on a level, you can skip it.</strong> There\u2019s a world of levels to explore. Maybe a solution lies somewhere else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/IV---Come-back-later_2.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/_Heading_Export_Keep_it_real_2.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/extras/VI---Random-Gameplay_7.gif?t=1751373684\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806720?t=1751373684","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/03e459e445b63224fcaf7b5577d999d9f8e75b4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751373684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/0f8b98ae32347e03dcf7740f4558a9e7602eac67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751373684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806720/0f8b98ae32347e03dcf7740f4558a9e7602eac67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751373684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74